    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-10-20T21:16:58+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-20T21:16:58+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:46:58Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:46:58Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A trough of low pressure lingers about the east, before weakening from late Wednesday. A slow moving high pressure system in the Tasman Sea will re-establish a ridge across southern parts from Wednesday. A trough is then forecast to briefly move into the west on Thursday, before another trough and cold front move more broadly across SA on Friday and Saturday.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW006" description="Riverland" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-10-20T21:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T10:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower near the eastern border, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm, possibly severe with damaging winds, large hail and heavy rain which may lead to flash flooding. Light winds.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-10-21T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-20T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower. The chance of a thunderstorm in the early morning. Light winds. Overnight temperatures falling to around 12 with daytime temperatures reaching the high 20s.</text>
                <text type="fire_danger">No Rating</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:10am to 4:20pm, UV Index predicted to reach 9 [Very High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-10-22T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-21T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Mostly sunny. The chance of fog in the early morning, mainly in the west. Light winds becoming northerly 15 to 20 km/h in the morning then tending northeasterly in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-10-23T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-22T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower in the west in the evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm in the west in the evening. Light winds becoming north to northwesterly 15 to 20 km/h during the morning then becoming light during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 17 with daytime temperatures reaching the low to mid 30s.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-10-24T00:00:00+10:30" end-time-local="2026-10-25T00:00:00+10:30" start-time-utc="2026-10-23T13:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-10-24T13:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. High chance of showers, most likely in the afternoon and evening. The chance of a thunderstorm in the afternoon and evening. Light winds becoming southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h during the morning then tending southerly during the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching around 30.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
